Ylsa is a Sensor from [[Geography/Althane/Brejvasing/index|Brejvasing]] with a specialty in horticulture. She's travelling the [[Geography/Althane/The Occident|Occident]] for new kinds of flora that might be cultivated for good use in the motherland. Among other equipment, she has a cloak that keeps her cool despite trekking through the [[Geography/Althane/Lunae Badlands/index|Lunae Badlands]].

Ylsa is a tan [[Bestiary/Spark of Humanity#Elf|Elf]] with a completely black sclera, long pointed ears, and a stick-like frame.
